WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.528
Hi! Today we talk about jobs.

2
00:00:06.928 --> 00:00:09.624
What do you do for a living?

3
00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:14.293
Here are a few jobs:

4
00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:16.813
the doctor

5
00:00:17.213 --> 00:00:19.285
the cook

6
00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:21.781
the teacher

7
00:00:22.181 --> 00:00:24.397
the waiter

8
00:00:24.797 --> 00:00:27.037
the student

9
00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:29.653
the hairdresser

10
00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:35.791
What do you do? Listen:

11
00:00:36.191 --> 00:00:38.455
I'm a teacher.

12
00:00:38.855 --> 00:00:44.287
Careful: no article! Not: ein Lehrer.

13
00:00:44.687 --> 00:00:47.287
And a woman says:

14
00:00:47.687 --> 00:00:50.047
I'm a doctor.

15
00:00:51.733 --> 00:00:57.069
Many jobs have two forms. For a man:

16
00:00:57.469 --> 00:00:59.565
the (male) teacher

17
00:00:59.965 --> 00:01:03.837
For a woman, -in goes at the end:

18
00:01:04.237 --> 00:01:06.501
the (female) teacher

19
00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:11.301
The same: der Kellner, die Kellnerin.

20
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:17.016
Where do you work? Listen:

21
00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:20.568
I work at the hospital.

22
00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:24.672
With arbeiten we need an extra e:

23
00:01:25.072 --> 00:01:27.288
I work

24
00:01:27.688 --> 00:01:30.072
you work

25
00:01:30.472 --> 00:01:34.032
he works, she works

26
00:01:34.432 --> 00:01:36.840
we work

27
00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:42.357
Listen: Mr Braun and Ms Kim.

28
00:01:42.757 --> 00:01:45.525
What do you do for a living?

29
00:01:45.925 --> 00:01:48.717
I'm a programmer.

30
00:01:49.117 --> 00:01:51.645
Where do you work?

31
00:01:52.045 --> 00:01:55.941
At Siemens. And you?

32
00:01:56.341 --> 00:01:58.413
I'm a cook.

33
00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:08.772
Now you! What do you do? Where do you work? Or what do you study?

34
00:02:17.467 --> 00:02:21.603
Great! Now you can:

35
00:02:22.003 --> 00:02:26.907
You talk about jobs and say where you work.

36
00:02:27.307 --> 00:02:29.427
See you soon!
